      "key": "quickFacts",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/sewellia_speciosa_en/",
      "html": "<p>Maximum length is around 6 cm.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "beforeYouBuy",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/sewellia_speciosa_en/",
      "html": "<p>Currently we were able to import this nice hillstream loach from Laos for the first time.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/sewellia_speciosa_en/",
      "html": "<p>The species is restricted to the Kong river influence in Laos and Vietnam.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "diet",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/sewellia_speciosa_en/",
      "html": "<p>One must make sure that the fish get enough food. Frozen food, especially bloodworm, is readily taken.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "behaviour",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/sewellia_speciosa_en/",
      "html": "<p>Like all Sewellia these fish like strong current. They are completely peaceful against tankmates, may they belong to their own or to different species.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "dimorphism",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/sewellia_speciosa_en/",
      "html": "<p>The species has a very interesting sexual dimorphism. Males – which are in general more tiny than females – develope patches of tubercles on the pectoral fins. The sense of this is not researched yet.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "notes",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/sewellia_speciosa_en/",
      "html": "<p>Lexicon: Sewellia: dedication name. speciosa: Latin, means “beautiful, showy”.</p>"
    },
